OneTimeUseIdPolicy::consume
├── given checkAction validated the caller's consume in this transaction
│   └── it should execute (the validation already burned)
├── given no validation preceded it
│   └── it should revert with BurnNotValidated and spend nothing
├── it should write nothing (no spend, no nomination, no admission), however often it runs
├── given a stranger calls with the account's id
│   └── it should revert with BurnNotValidated
└── given the caller's validation named a different id
    └── it should revert with BurnNotValidated
